• Working Capital Management : reporting new and existing transactions to processing and understanding funding, collateral and liquidity requirements, and identify optimization opportunities. &nbsp;

• Trade Finance Execution : understanding and processing letters of credit, bank guarantees, trade finance loans and other credit support instruments. &nbsp;

• Bank Facilities : supporting reporting and operational requirements across trade finance and credit facilities. &nbsp;

